          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five fields (minute hour day month weekday) in your zone. 0 8 * * 1-5 is weekdays at eight; @at 2030-09-12 09:00 is once, at that moment; @in 20m is once, twenty minutes from now.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "分 時 日 月 曜日 の五つの欄、あなたの時間帯で。0 8 * * 1-5 は平日八時、@at 2030-09-12 09:00 はその時刻に一度、@in 20m は二十分後に一度。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "五个字段（分 时 日 月 周），按你的时区。0 8 * * 1-5 是工作日八点；@at 2030-09-12 09:00 是那一刻一次；@in 20m 是二十分钟后一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Five fields, in your own zone. Leave it empty and it is read once a day.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "5 つのフィールド、あなたのタイムゾーンで。空のままなら 1 日に 1 回読みます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "五个字段，按你所在的时区。留空则每天读取一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Fold %@ into %@. Its %lld facts, its links and the %lld pages under it move there, and %@ is gone afterwards.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$@ を %2$@ に統合します。%3$lld 件の事実、リンク、下にある %4$lld ページが移り、%5$@ はなくなります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "将 %1$@ 并入 %2$@。它的 %3$lld 条事实、链接和其下的 %4$lld 个页面都会移过去，之后 %5$@ 将不复存在。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Folder": {
