          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "対象の文字列"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "匹配内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it may reach": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "触れてよいもの"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它可以访问什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should I ask?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "何を聞きますか？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要问什么？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What should the reply say? (optional)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "返信の内容は？（任意）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回复应该说什么？（可选）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What sort of place": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どのような場所か"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "属于哪种地方"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the day holds and what is waiting for you, sent to you as mail. It is an ordinary schedule called \"Daily brief\"; change what it asks for in Schedules below.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今日の予定と待っていることを、メールで送ります。実体は「Daily brief」という通常のスケジュールで、内容は下のスケジュールで変えられます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "今天有什么安排、有什么在等你，以邮件发送。它其实是一条名为“Daily brief”的普通日程；在下面的日程中可以修改内容。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What the rules would do": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ルールの結果"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "规则会做什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to call it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "呼び名"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "称呼"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to do, as you would say it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "何をするか、話しかけるように"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "做什么，像平时说话一样"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to estimate from": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "見積もりの根拠"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "估算依据"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to show": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "表示する内容"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "显示内容"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What to work toward": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "目指すこと"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "要达成什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What used to be true": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前の答え"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "以前的答案"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What was written is gone.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "書いた内容は失われます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "已写的内容会丢失。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What will hold it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用途のメモ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用途备注"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you asked not to be told about. Unmute one to hear about it again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伝えないよう頼んだもの。ミュートを解除すると、また伝えます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你要求不再告诉你的事。取消静音后会再次告诉你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What you sign in with. Changing it takes your sessions and API tokens with it, so nothing has to be signed in again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "サインインに使う名前です。変更してもセッションと API トークンはそのまま引き継がれ、再サインインは不要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "用于登录的名字。修改后会话和 API 令牌会一并迁移，无需重新登录。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent answered on your behalf, what it is about to, and what it left alone and why.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントがあなたの代わりに返信したもの、これから返信するもの、返信しなかったものとその理由。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手替你回复了什么、即将回复什么、没有回复什么以及原因。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent answered to each question, from each source, and what the grader made of it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各質問に対して、エージェントがそれぞれのソースから何と答え、採点者がどう判定したか。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的助手从每个来源对每个问题的回答，以及评分者的判定。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent did on its own, as it happened. Ask about it here, or go back to the main chat.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントが自分で行ったことを、起きた順に記録しています。ここで尋ねるか、メインのチャットに戻れます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手自行完成的事，按发生顺序记录。可以在这里问它，或回到主对话。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent filed after your recent conversations, newest first. Strike anything it should not have kept.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "最近の会話のあとにエージェントが整理したもの。新しい順です。残すべきでないものは取り消してください。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手在你最近的对话之后归档的内容，最新在前。不该记的可以划掉。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent left running on your computers, from every chat. A command still running after 24 hours is stopped.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントがあなたのコンピューターでバックグラウンドに残したコマンド（すべてのチャット分）。24 時間を超えて実行中のものは停止されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助手在你的电脑上留在后台运行的命令，来自所有对话。运行超过 24 小时的命令会被停止。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent marks as high priority appears here.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントが優先度高とした内容がここに表示されます。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你的助手标为高优先级的邮件会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent may do without asking, in a schedule, a goal or overnight, when there is nobody to confirm. Anything not ticked is refused then, and your agent tells you what it would have done. Mail sorting and replies drafted from incoming mail only ever read, whatever is ticked.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "スケジュール、目標、夜間の処理など、確認できる人がいないときに、尋ねずに行ってよいこと。チェックしていないものはその場合は行わず、何をするつもりだったかを伝えます。届いたメールの分類や返信の下書きは、設定にかかわらず読むだけです。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在计划任务、目标或夜间运行中，没有人可以确认时，你的助手可以不经询问去做的事。未勾选的事那时会被拒绝，助手会告诉你它本来要做什么。整理来信和根据来信起草回复，无论如何设置都只读。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent says on its own": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントが自分から伝えること"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "助理主动说的话"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What your agent told you unasked, newest first, with the messages each was about. Mute one to stop hearing about things like it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "エージェントが頼まれずに伝えたこと。新しい順で、それぞれ元になったメール付きです。ミュートすると、同じようなことは伝えなくなります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "代理不等你问就告诉你的事，最新的在前，附上每条涉及的邮件。静音一条，就不再听到类似的事。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "日時"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "时间"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When %@": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ のとき"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When all of these match": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "すべてに一致したとき"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当以下条件全部满足"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When and how to answer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いつ、どう返信するか"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "何时以及如何回复"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it may dream": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "夢を見る時間帯"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它何时可以做梦"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When it was true (2023-06)": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いつのことか（2023-06）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "何时成立（2023-06）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you are not there": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "不在のとき"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你不在时"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When, as a cron line": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "いつ（cron 形式）"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "何时（cron 格式）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where it went": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "使い道"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "钱花在哪了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where on it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "その中のどこ"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在哪个位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where the answer goes": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答えの届け先"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "答复送到哪里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where these are": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "場所"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所在位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where this server writes to you, such as when a domain’s DNS records stop resolving. Optional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ドメインの DNS レコードが解決しなくなったときなど、このサーバーからの連絡先です。省略可。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "本服务器与你联系的地址，例如某个域的 DNS 记录不再解析时。可选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Where what it finds is filed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "見つけたものを置く場所"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "它读到的内容归档到哪里"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which computer": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どのコンピューター"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪台电脑"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which computer each skill and connected server makes its requests through. A service that answers only inside one network, such as one behind a company VPN, needs a computer on that network.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "各スキルと接続サーバーのリクエストを、どのコンピューター経由で送るか。会社の VPN の内側など、特定のネットワーク内でしか応答しないサービスには、そのネットワーク上のコンピューターが必要です。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每个技能和已连接服务器的请求经由哪台电脑发出。只在某个网络内响应的服务（例如公司 VPN 之后的服务）需要该网络上的电脑。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which day suits you for the dentist?": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "歯医者はどの日がいいですか？"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪天去看牙医合适？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which mailbox": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どのメールボックス"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪个邮箱"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Which runs read it": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "どの実行が読むか"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "哪些任务会读取"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you are asleep your agent works through what arrived, writes up the month, and tidies what it knows. It never forgets anything on its own.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたが眠っているあいだに、届いたものを読み、その月をまとめ、知っていることを整理します。自分から何かを忘れることはありません。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你睡着时，助手会处理新到的内容、写这个月的记录，并整理它所知道的。它绝不会自行删除任何东西。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While you are idle, your agent now and then offers one of its ideas: something it could do for you. The whole list is under Ideas.": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "操作していない間に、エージェントがときどき、あなたのためにできることを一つ提案します。一覧は「アイデア」にあります。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在你空闲时，你的助手会不时提出一个它能为你做的事。完整列表在“想法”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Who you are, how you write, what matters to you. \"I am the treasurer of the sailing club; anything from the club is important; sign as Z.\"": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "あなたが誰で、どう書き、何が大事か。「私はヨットクラブの会計です。クラブからのものは重要。Z と署名する。」"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "你是谁、如何写作、什么重要。\"我是帆船俱乐部的司库；来自俱乐部的邮件都重要；署名 Z。\""
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whom": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "誰に"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "回复对象"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Why it failed": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失敗した理由"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "失败原因"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With attachments": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添付あり"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "有附件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Without": {
      "localizations": {
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "添付なし"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
